{"guide":{"questionsToConsider":["Which menus or packages do you want customers to pick from, and do they change by season?","How far ahead do you need orders, and should the date question block anything shorter?","Do you offer staffed service, and what do you need to know about the venue before you agree to it?","Who checks allergy details with the kitchen before an order is confirmed?"],"howToUseResponses":"Start with the serving time and headcount, because those decide whether you can take the order at all. Pass the dietary counts and any severe allergy details to the kitchen before you quote, and confirm in writing what you can and can't prepare safely. For deliveries, give the driver the address, the on-site contact and the access notes together so nobody is calling round on the day.","customizeSteps":["Replace the menu options with your own packages, and add a short description to each so customers know what's included.","Edit the extras to match what you really supply, such as linen, staff or equipment hire.","Put the link on your catering page or in your quote emails, and test both the collection and delivery paths before you share it."],"faqs":[{"q":"What should a catering order form include?","a":"The customer's details, the event date and serving time, the number of guests, the menu and extras, dietary needs, and how the food gets there. For deliveries you also need the venue address and a contact on the day."},{"q":"How do I collect dietary requirements for catering?","a":"Ask for a count for each need rather than a yes or no, and ask separately about severe allergies. This template does both, and only asks for allergy details when someone has one."},{"q":"Is a catering order confirmed when the form is submitted?","a":"Not with this template. The ending tells customers you will confirm the menu and price first, which gives the kitchen time to check quantities and allergies."},{"q":"What's the difference between a catering order form and a catering inquiry form?","a":"An inquiry form explores options for someone still deciding. An order form collects the choices someone has already made so you can prepare and deliver them."}]},"doc":{"schemaVersion":9,"title":"Catering order","description":"Menu, headcount, dietary needs and delivery details for one event, in one order.","blocks":[{"id":"blk_catering00","ref":"welcome","title":"Hello! Let's get your catering order down. Have your guest numbers and menu choice to hand.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"buttonLabel":"Start","type":"welcome"},{"id":"blk_catering01","ref":"contact","title":"Who's placing the order?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"contact_info","fields":["first_name","last_name","email","phone"]},{"id":"blk_catering02","ref":"organisation","title":"Are you ordering for a company or organisation? If so, which one?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"short_text","unique":false,"minLength":0,"maxLength":120},{"id":"blk_catering03","ref":"event_type","title":"What's the occasion?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"dropdown","options":[{"id":"opt_business_meeting","label":"Business meeting","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_conference_or_training","label":"Conference or training day","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_wedding","label":"Wedding","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_birthday_or_family","label":"Birthday or family party","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_funeral_or_memorial","label":"Funeral or memorial","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_fundraiser","label":"Fundraiser","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_something_else","label":"Something else","image_key":null}]},{"id":"blk_catering04","ref":"serve_time","title":"When should the food be ready to eat?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"date","disablePast":true,"dateFormat":"YYYY-MM-DD","includeTime":true,"timeStepMinutes":30,"timeMin":"06:00","timeMax":"23:00"},{"id":"blk_catering05","ref":"guests","title":"How many people are you feeding?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"number","unique":false,"min":1,"max":5000,"integerOnly":true},{"id":"blk_catering06","ref":"menu","title":"Which menu would you like?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_breakfast_and_pastries","label":"Breakfast and pastries","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_sandwich_and_salad","label":"Sandwich and salad lunch","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_hot_buffet","label":"Hot buffet","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_canap_s_and","label":"Canapés and finger food","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_plated_sit_down","label":"Plated sit-down meal","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_catering07","ref":"extras","title":"Anything to add?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"multi_select","options":[{"id":"opt_desserts","label":"Desserts","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_fruit_platter","label":"Fruit platter","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_tea_and_coffee","label":"Tea and coffee","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_soft_drinks_and","label":"Soft drinks and juice","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_plates_cutlery_and","label":"Plates, cutlery and napkins","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_serving_staff","label":"Serving staff","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_clearing_up_afterwards","label":"Clearing up afterwards","image_key":null}],"minSelections":0,"maxSelections":7,"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_catering08","ref":"dietary","title":"Any dietary needs? Give a count for each.","description":"For example: 6 vegetarian, 2 vegan, 3 gluten free, 1 halal.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_catering09","ref":"severe_allergy","title":"Does anyone have a severe allergy we need to plan the kitchen around?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"yes_no","yesLabel":"Yes","noLabel":"No"},{"id":"blk_catering10","ref":"allergy_details","title":"Tell us the allergy, how many guests have it, and how serious it is.","description":"We'll confirm what we can safely prepare before the order is final.","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_catering11","ref":"service_style","title":"How should the food reach you?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"single_select","options":[{"id":"opt_i_ll_collect","label":"I'll collect it","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_deliver_and_drop","label":"Deliver and drop off","image_key":null},{"id":"opt_deliver_set_up","label":"Deliver, set up and serve","image_key":null}],"allowOther":false},{"id":"blk_catering12","ref":"venue","title":"Where are we delivering to?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"address","fields":["street","city","state","postal"],"location":"off"},{"id":"blk_catering13","ref":"onsite_contact","title":"Who will meet the driver on the day?","required":true,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"contact_info","fields":["first_name","phone"]},{"id":"blk_catering14","ref":"access","title":"Anything about the venue we should know?","description":"Loading bay, stairs or lifts, the room we're serving in, and when we can get in to set up.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":800,"aiQualityCheck":false},{"id":"blk_catering15","ref":"budget","title":"Roughly what's your budget per guest?","description":"In your own currency. It helps us suggest swaps if the menu comes in over.","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"number","unique":false,"min":0,"integerOnly":false},{"id":"blk_catering16","ref":"notes","title":"Anything else we should know?","required":false,"visibility":null,"image_key":null,"agentHints":null,"media":null,"type":"long_text","minLength":0,"maxLength":1000,"aiQualityCheck":false}],"endings":[{"id":"end_catering01","ref":"end_thanks","title":"Order request received 🍽️","bodyMd":"We'll check the date, quantities and any dietary needs, then send you a confirmed menu and price. The order is final once you've approved that.","imageUrl":null,"redirectDelaySec":4,"showSummary":false,"kind":"success","requirements":[]}],"endingRules":[],"logic":[{"id":"rl_catering01","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"severe_allergy"},"op":"eq","value":true}],"groups":[]},"from":"severe_allergy","target":"allergy_details","targetKind":"block","branch":"true"},{"id":"rl_catering02","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"severe_allergy"},"op":"eq","value":false}],"groups":[]},"from":"severe_allergy","target":"service_style","targetKind":"block","branch":"true"},{"id":"rl_catering03","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"service_style"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_i_ll_collect"}],"groups":[]},"from":"service_style","target":"budget","targetKind":"block","branch":"true"},{"id":"rl_catering04","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"service_style"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_deliver_and_drop"}],"groups":[]},"from":"service_style","target":"venue","targetKind":"block","branch":"true"},{"id":"rl_catering05","action_kind":"goto","when":{"op":"and","conditions":[{"left":{"kind":"ref","ref":"service_style"},"op":"eq","value":"opt_deliver_set_up"}],"groups":[]},